{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented the comparison-summary feature.\n\n**Design**\n- `summarize-assistants.mjs` filters for eligible runs (`status === \"complete\"`, `acceptance_status === \"pass\"`, `comparison_eligible !== false`), validates only eligible records, groups by `assistant`, picks the best run by score → elapsed → `run_id`, computes numeric median elapsed time, and returns summaries sorted by assistant.\n- `render-comparison-table.mjs` validates every summary, preserves order, emits the exact Markdown header and separator, escapes `|` as `\\|`, formats median milliseconds as `x.xxx s`, and renders `_No eligible runs._` for empty input.\n\n**Edge cases covered by added tests**\n- Ineligible runs are skipped and their invalid fields are ignored.\n- Best-run ties are broken by `run_id` when score and elapsed time are equal.\n- Median averages the two middle values for an even run count.\n- Both functions throw `TypeError` for invalid eligible/summary data.\n\n**Verification**\n`node --test benchmark/fixtures/T3-comparison-summary/comparison-summary.test.mjs benchmark/fixtures/T3-comparison-summary/student-tests.mjs`\n- 9 tests passed, 0 failed."}}
